  36:     - Match train to station group where |couplers| == |station size|.
  37:     - Rotate/flip train so marker pixels face the same-color boundary stripe of the target region.
  38:     - Translate so couplers align exactly onto station cells; erase original position.
  39: 
  40:     Key insight: Coupler count selects the docking target; marker color encodes which boundary stripe to face, fixing the unique orientation.
